X:1
T:Tinsagu nu Hana
O:Japan (Okinawa)
N:Traditional Okinawan folk song (Yaeyama, the lead sheet header says Okinawa Yaeyama folk song), also spelled Tensagu no Hana. Melody from the first eight bars of the mu-tech.org WorldTrad MIDI (Tensagu_No_Hana, Country arrangement), chords from its generated lead sheet; later verses of the source repeat this tune, one with a small variation in bar 7 and a final one a minor third higher. Lyrics left out.
